    Fitur:
      1. Auto Claim Daily + Playtime
      2. Auto Collect Offline Report
      3. Auto Dispatch (Driver NPC & Truck sendiri dipisah) - mode: $/mile, Payout, Shortest
      4. Auto Refuel
      5. Auto Repair (Driver NPC / Truck sendiri dipisah)
      6. Auto Withdraw bank -> cash selalu >= minimum (default $100.000)
      7. Auto Execute setelah rejoin / pindah server (update) lewat queue_on_teleport
      8. Auto Update  : kalau game minta update, otomatis tekan "UPDATE NOW" (RequestUpdate)
      9. Auto Reconnect: kalau kena disconnect / server shutdown, otomatis rejoin
